ROW root-original 0 COLON
ROW root-other 0 PLAIN
ROW root-colon-query 0 :::lost
ROW root-plain-query 0 ::lost
ROW leading-namespace-original 0 LEADING_NAMESPACE
ROW leading-namespace-rooted-report 0 ORDINARY_NAMESPACE
ROW leading-namespace-inscope 0 LEADING_NAMESPACE
ROW trailing-namespace-root-join 0 ORDINARY_NAMESPACE
ROW trailing-namespace-inscope 0 TRAILING_NAMESPACE
ROW bracket-root-context 0 BRACKET_NAMESPACE
ROW bracket-rooted-context 0 BRACKET_NAMESPACE
ROW live-root-commands 0 {tell socket subst open eof lremove pwd glob list pid exec auto_load_index time unknown coroinject eval lassign lrange fblocked lfilter lsearch auto_import gets throw lappend proc break variable llength auto_execok return linsert error ledit catch lpop info clock split array if fconfigure coroutine concat join lreplace source fcopy global switch auto_qualify update divmod fpclassify close cd for auto_load file append lreverse format lmap unload :lost read set package namespace binary scan frexp apply trace const seek zlib while lost chan flush after vwait capture dict uplevel continue lseq modf try rename foreach lset timer fileevent yieldto timerate regexp zipfs lrepeat upvar tailcall encoding unset expr load regsub remquo interp exit coroprobe puts incr lindex lsort tclLog unicode string yield}
